'''Drybite''' is a [[Blood Spiral]] spell used to deal very high damage to a targeted Seeker or Titan. When cast, the spell appears as a stream of purple energy. It's able to send [[Kipperin]] and [[Sabriel|Powerbonded Sabriel]] (further protected by her Truth Shield ability) back to their amulets, as well as immobilize [[Sorcerel|Powerbonded Sorcerel]] for a moment, all in a single use of the spell. 

== History ==
During the Foundation's assault on [[the Professor's castle]], Drybite was used by [[Rassimov]] to send [[Kipperin]], flying attached to [[Dante Vale]], to its Amulet in a single hit. This forced Dante to land next to Rassimov.{{Source|The Divine Comedy}}

By the entrance of the [[Fortress of Iron Will]], during the war against the Blood Spiral, [[Tantras]] used Drybite to neutralize [[Sorcerel|Powerbonded Sorcerel]] for a few moments following [[Sophie Casterwill|Sophie]] gaining the upper hand in the confrontation versus [[Kiel]]. Sorcerel was quickly able to recover and be of use again to Sophie.{{Source|The Spiral War}}

[[Harrison Fears]] used the spell to send Sophie's [[Sabriel|Powerbonded Sabriel]], protected by her Truth Shield ability, back to her amulet during the [[Vampire Hunter]] mission at the [[Castle of Vlad Dracul]]. {{Source|Lok's Leadership}}

[[Wind]] once used Drybite on a Sabriel Titan. {{Source|TCG:PRO-027|PRO-027}}

